OL,3,GNEWSANarnia book found in charity shop
OL,4,Asells for #1k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare first edition of The Lion, the
OL,7,FWitch and the Wardrobe has sold for
OL,8,F#1,000 after it was spotted at a
OL,9,Fcharity shop.
OL,11,FThe 1950 copy of the first of the
OL,12,FChronicles of Narnia by CS Lewis was
OL,13,Fidentified by a sharp-eyed volunteer at
OL,14,Fthe Oxfam bookshop in Truro, Cornwall.
OL,16,FThe children's fantasy novel was put up
OL,17,Ffor sale on the charity's online
OL,18,Fselling portal and was quickly snapped
OL,19,Fup.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
